+# This fork — Cosmos-3 Nano → Omnimodal Human-Motion World Model
+
+> We adapt **Cosmos-3 Nano** into an omnimodal **human-motion** world model by introducing
+> **3D human motion as a body-native continuous action modality**. The model generates human
+> motion from language, images, videos, and audio, and uses human motion as a **control signal**
+> for context-conditioned video/audio generation.
+>
+> Cosmos-3 Nano를 사람 모션 중심의 omnimodal world model로 확장한다. Text/image/video/audio를
+> condition으로 받아 3D human motion을 생성하고, 반대로 human motion을 control signal로 사용해
+> image context 기반 video/audio를 생성한다.
+
+**Principles (load-bearing):**
+1. **Text/image/video/audio are *conditions*, not targets** — we reuse Cosmos-3's frozen
+   understanding prior; we do **not** train a captioner / VLM reasoner.
+2. **Motion is both input and output** — the new continuous modality.
+3. **Video/audio are outputs only with sufficient visual/context condition** (an initial image/scene);
+   context-free `motion → video` is ill-posed and avoided.
+
+**Task space.** Direction is *observation/instruction → motion* and *motion + context → world*:
+
+| Motion as output (primary) | Motion as control → world (later) | Excluded ❌ |
+| --- | --- | --- |
+| Text → Motion (BONES-SEED) | Motion + Initial Image → Future Video | Video → Text |
+| Image / Video → Motion (NymeriaPlus) | Motion + Text + Image → Future Video | Motion → Text |
+| Text + Image/Video → Motion | Motion + Image → Audio + Video | Video + Motion → Text |
+| Video + Audio (+Text) → Motion | Motion + Text + Image → Audio + Video | context-free Motion → Video |
+
+**Methods** (shared: motion modality + freeze-reasoner / adapt-generator): (1) projection-only
+(sanity); (2) motion heads + LoRA on `*_moe_gen` (current run); (3) **main** = frozen Cosmos +
+a **Motion-Transformer bridge** cross-attending the frozen reasoner/generator (bidirectional,
+no text output).
+
+**Phased plan:** (1) motion-modality attachment → (2) text→motion prior → (3) visual/audio→motion
+grounding → (4) motion-controlled world generation → (5) joint omnimodal mixture.
+
+➡️ **Full project doc, task table, training mixture, and status:**
+[`/home/jungbin_cho/cosmos_motion_ft/README.md`](/home/jungbin_cho/cosmos_motion_ft/README.md)
+(code, exporters, `motion_decode.py`, `train_motion_ft.py`, `sample_motion.py` live there).
+See also [`CLAUDE.md`](./CLAUDE.md) "Local project" for the implementation notes.
